{"seq":3,"slug":"binary-variable-stars","title":"双星与变星","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/stellar-physics/binary-variable-stars","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"binary-star-systems","title":"双星系统与质量转移","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/stellar-physics/binary-variable-stars/binary-star-systems","wordCount":2184,"readingTime":9},{"seq":2,"slug":"variable-star-classes","title":"变星分类与测距","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/stellar-physics/binary-variable-stars/variable-star-classes","wordCount":2215,"readingTime":9},{"seq":3,"slug":"nova-supernova-physics","title":"新星与超新星物理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/stellar-physics/binary-variable-stars/nova-supernova-physics","wordCount":2607,"readingTime":11}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"双星与变星\">双星与变星</h1><p>本章研究双星系统的物理过程以及各类变星的脉动机制与天文应用。银河系中约一半的恒星处于双星或多星系统中，双星间的相互作用产生了许多单星演化中不可能出现的天体物理现象。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心主题\">核心主题</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>双星系统</strong> — 轨道力学、洛希瓣几何、质量转移类型与后果</li>\n<li><strong>变星分类</strong> — 造父变星、天琴RR型变星、Mira变星的脉动机制与测距应用</li>\n<li><strong>新星与超新星</strong> — 白矮星表面热核爆发、Ia型超新星宇宙学应用</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"关键物理概念\">关键物理概念</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>重要性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>洛希瓣</td>\n<td>等引力势面包围各星的最大闭合区域</td>\n<td>决定质量转移是否发生</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>周光关系</td>\n<td>造父变星脉动周期与绝对光度的关系</td>\n<td>宇宙距离阶梯基础</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>钱德拉塞卡极限</td>\n<td>白矮星最大质量 1.44 M☉</td>\n<td>Ia超新星触发条件</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n"}